    <!--
      Noise suppression for whole-project "Inspect Code" runs. These inspections
      only flag prose in Markdown/HTML docs and comments (including the bundled
      third-party zstd sources), never app-correctness issues, and produced
      thousands of false "errors"/typos. Re-enable individually if you need them.
      Note: the C/C++ noise from app/.cxx (Clangd/ClangTidy/OCUnused/…) is best
      removed by right-clicking app/.cxx -> Mark Directory as -> Excluded; that
      folder is generated native-build output and is already in .gitignore.
    -->
